from the source under gui/ and links the debark engine from the repository
root. Both halves are covered by the same Apache-2.0 licence and the same
copyright.

This distribution may include third-party software. Such software is
governed by the terms of its own licenses; see gui/go.sum and the module
cache for the current dependency list, docs/dependency-review.md for what
